    "Author": "Duong Dieu Phap",
    "Description": "Prism Pride Dark brings hot pink icons and soft gray details to a charcoal viewer with a hint of transparency. Its toolbar and gallery share a muted rose tint and let a little more of the window backdrop show through. The thin, rounded icons match the light edition, alongside the official six-color Pride logo."
